### 1. USER reads all books -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books
Authorization: Basic user user
Accept: application/json

### 2. USER reads one book -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books/1
Authorization: Basic user user
Accept: application/json

### 3. USER tries to create a book -> 403 Forbidden
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books
Authorization: Basic user user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Should not be saved",
  "author": "Nobody",
  "publishedYear": 2000
}

### 4. ADMIN creates a book -> 200
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Pragmatic Programmer",
  "author": "Andrew Hunt, David Thomas",
  "publishedYear": 1999
}

### 5. ADMIN updates a book -> 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Kobzar (updated by admin)",
  "author": "Taras Shevchenko",
  "publishedYear": 1840
}

### 6. ADMIN tries to delete a book -> 403 Forbidden
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books/2
Authorization: Basic admin admin

### 7. SUPERADMIN deletes a book -> 200
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books/3
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin

### 8. ADMIN opens admin-only route -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/hello/admin
Authorization: Basic admin admin

### 9. USER tries admin-only route -> 403 Forbidden
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/hello/admin
Authorization: Basic user user

### 10. Wrong password -> 401 Unauthorized
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books
Authorization: Basic user wrongpass
Accept: application/json

###
